    "intro": "Asahi Refining Usa has $574M in federal contract obligations in FY26 to date. Asahi Refining Usa has 152 awards so far in the fiscal year, with an average award size of $3.8M. Asahi Refining Usa's obligations are up 68.9% year over year. Asahi Refining Usa's obligations by fiscal year were $368M in FY21, $153M in FY22, $0 in FY23, $355M in FY24, $340M in FY25, and $574M in FY26 to date. Asahi Refining Usa's current-year totals are partial because the snapshot covers the fiscal year to date. Asahi Refining Usa's total obligations and award-count figures show that federal activity in FY26 is larger than in prior listed years. Asahi Refining Usa's average award size of $3.8M and the count of 152 awards indicate the current-year portfolio includes multiple mid-sized contract actions. Asahi Refining Usa's year-over-year increase of 68.9% reflects the change in obligations between the comparable periods presented.",
